)"},{"id":1290759928,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjkwNzU5OTI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/docdb","name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"YugabyteDB core features"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"Huqicheng","id":31775227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzc1MjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31775227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng","html_url":"https://github.com/Huqicheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"Huqicheng","id":31775227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzc1MjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31775227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng","html_url":"https://github.com/Huqicheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-11-06T00:24:03Z","updated_at":"2022-12-15T21:24:29Z","closed_at":"2022-12-15T21:24:29Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-4157](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-4157)\r\n### Description\r\nUpdate:\r\nThis issue is more like a dst issue. The beta colocated database doesn't have this issue.\r\nA simple example with replication factor 3 could reproduce this error with around a 5% chance.\r\n```\r\n./bin/yb-ctl destroy && ./bin/yb-ctl create --rf=3 && ./bin/ysqlsh\r\nCREATE TABLEGROUP tg1;\r\n-- Sleep here for 30 seconds. Giving enough time for bootstrap solve this issue.\r\nCREATE TABLE test_tbl (\r\n  h INT PRIMARY KEY,\r\n  a INT,\r\n  b FLOAT CONSTRAINT test_tbl_uniq UNIQUE WITH (colocation_id=654321)\r\n) WITH (colocation_id=123456) TABLEGROUP tg1;\r\nCREATE INDEX test_tbl_idx ON test_tbl (a ASC) WITH (colocation_id=11223344);\r\n```\r\nThe error is somehow one tserver `x` is bootstraping a tablegroup parent table tablet `t` for a long time so that the tablet `t` raft group on tserver `x` doesn't properly replicate all states. An error occurs: `[ts-2] F1106 21:16:12.204051 17945 tablet.cc:3979] Check failed: _s.ok() Bad status: Not found (yb/tablet/tablet_metadata.cc:529): Table <unknown_table_name> (000033e8000030008000000000004001) not found in Raft group 8c7c16280c7d4a2bb9ee1f18f039c404`\r\nSleeping 30 seconds after creating the tablegroup gives enough time for bootstrapping seems to solve this issue (no issue happened in 1000 runs).\r\nMy test log link: https://drive.google.com/file/d/15yIQj77umkBHEBOtNYtXOM5nLkDiLcD_/view?usp=share_link\r\nThe error I describe here is the same as the error showed in the flaky test: `ybd release --cxx-test pgwrapper_pg_index_backfill-test --gtest_filter PgIndexBackfillTest.Tablegroup --clang15` and `PgLibPqTest.ColocatedTablegroups`","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/14873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/14873/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}